        // written.  Measured on a 6-row probe (`localparam signed [7:0] a`,
        // `unsigned [7:0] b`, `parameter signed [3:0] c`, `[7:0] d`,
        // `signed e`, `signed [1:0][3:0] f`): every signed/unsigned row
